      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Primero nació un varón en la noche. Se llamaba Kumulipo.",
          "en": "First, a boy was born in the night. His name was Kumulipo."
        },
        {
          "es": "Es el mismo nombre del canto. Significa «fuente de la oscuridad profunda».",
          "en": "It is the same name as the chant. It means \"source of the deep dark.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Después nació una mujer en la noche. Se llamaba Pōʻele, «noche oscura».",
          "en": "Then a girl was born in the night. Her name was Pōʻele, \"dark night.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Así, los dos primeros seres del canto nacieron de la noche.",
          "en": "So the first two beings in the chant were both born from the night."
        }
